# Normalise every text file to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# `rustfmt.toml` sets `newline_style = "Unix"`, so a Windows checkout with
# git's default `core.autocrlf=true` produces CRLF files that
# `cargo fmt --check` then rejects — a CI failure that has nothing to do with
# the change under review. Pinning `eol=lf` here overrides the local setting
# for everyone.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touch these.
*.png   binary
*.ico   binary
*.icns  binary

# Proxifier writes profiles with CRLF, and `ppx-core` round-trips a file
# byte-for-byte. Rewriting line endings would break the fixture and the
# snapshot taken from it.
*.ppx   -text
